<p>Hi <%= @requested_by.name %>,</p>

<p>We’ve received your request to terminate <%= link_to @event.name, event_url(@event) %>.</p>

<p>
  A member of the HCB team will reach out to confirm the details and walk you through the next steps,
  including what happens to any remaining funds. Until then, your organization keeps working as usual.
</p>

<p>
  Changed your mind? You can withdraw the request from your
  <%= link_to "organization’s settings", edit_event_url(@event, tab: "details") %> at any time before we process it.
</p>

<p>
  Warmly,<br>
  The HCB team
</p>
